step Green Iron Bracers to 175
  tip Green Iron Bracers is orange at 150 (yellow 165, green 177, grey 190): about 28 crafts to 175. Each takes 6 Iron Bar and 1 Green Dye. Six Iron Bars and a Green Dye a craft; Green Dye comes from tailoring, leatherworking and trade supplies vendors. Orange to 165 on Forever, so a point every craft for the first fifteen. Needs an anvil nearby.
  craft 3501 until 175

step Blacksmithing recipes at 175
  tip Back to a Blacksmithing trainer: Solid Sharpening Stone (from 175).
  learn 9918

step Solid Sharpening Stone to 185
  tip Solid Sharpening Stone is yellow at 175 (yellow 175, green 180, grey 185): about 30 crafts to 185. Each takes 1 Solid Stone. One Solid Stone a craft (Mithril Deposits): cheap points between the iron and the steel bracers. Use the stones on your weapons or sell them.
  craft 9918 until 185

step Blacksmithing recipes at 185
  tip Back to a Blacksmithing trainer: Golden Scale Bracers (from 160).
  learn 7223

step Golden Scale Bracers to 205
  tip Golden Scale Bracers is yellow at 185 (yellow 185, green 197, grey 210): about 39 crafts to 205. Each takes 5 Steel Bar and 2 Heavy Grinding Stone. Make the 78 Heavy Grinding Stone first. Steel Bars are smelted from an Iron Bar and a Coal (Mining 165; Coal from trade and blacksmithing suppliers), so each bracer is five of each. Each bracer takes two Heavy Grinding Stones: make them first. Specialisation (optional): at 200 and character level 40, Grumnus Steelshaper (Ironforge) or Okothos Ironrager (Orgrimmar) starts The Art of the Armorsmith: 4 Ornate Mithril Helms, 2 Ornate Mithril Boots and an Ornate Mithril Breastplate, whose plans come from a Mithril Order quest chain. Ironus Coldsteel (Ironforge) or Borgosh Corebender (Orgrimmar) starts The Way of the Weaponsmith: 4 Moonsteel Broadswords, 4 Massive Iron Axes, 2 Heavy Mithril Axes and 2 Big Black Maces; on Forever the Moonsteel Broadsword plans (Zarena Cromwind, Booty Bay) and Massive Iron Axe plans bind when picked up, so buy and use them yourself. You can take only one; neither is needed for 300, and the beta never tested them (it stopped at level 30). Needs an anvil nearby.
  craft 3337 x78
  craft 7223 until 205

step Blacksmithing recipes at 205
  tip Heavy Mithril Breastplate (from 205) is taught only by the Artisan trainers: Alliance Brikk Keencraft (Stranglethorn Vale); Horde Brikk Keencraft (Stranglethorn Vale). You can train Artisan there now if you are level 35 (it needs Blacksmithing 200), which saves the trip at 225.
  learn 9959 npc 2836 only Alliance
  learn 9959 npc 2836 only Horde
  train Blacksmithing Artisan optional

step Heavy Mithril Breastplate to 225
  tip Heavy Mithril Breastplate is orange at 205 (yellow 225, green 235, grey 245): about 20 crafts to 225, a point every craft. Each takes 16 Mithril Bar. Sixteen Mithril Bars a craft and nothing else; orange to 225 on Forever, so a point every craft to the Artisan cap. Needs an anvil nearby. Blacksmithing 225 is a Legacy System milestone.
  craft 9959 until 225
  skill Blacksmithing 225

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Artisan (225-300)
section Blacksmithing 225-300

step Artisan Blacksmithing
  tip Artisan raises the cap from 225 to 300 for 5g (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs Blacksmithing 200 and character level 35, so you can take it on any visit from 200. Only a few trainers teach it: Alliance Brikk Keencraft (Stranglethorn Vale); Horde Brikk Keencraft (Stranglethorn Vale). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Learn now: Dense Weightstone (from 225), Heavy Mithril Boots (from 210), Solid Grinding Stone (from 175), Big Black Mace (from 205) and Dense Grinding Stone (from 225). 225-300 takes about 3g 60s of recipes, plus 44 Shadowgem, 596 Mithril Bar, 142 Thick Leather, 19 Aquamarine, 19 Star Ruby, 44 Solid Stone, 11 Black Pearl, 206 Rugged Leather, 2026 Thorium Bar, 801 Dense Stone and 10 Large Opal to gather or buy.
  level 35
  train Blacksmithing Artisan
  learn 16640 npc 2836 only Alliance
  learn 16640 npc 2836 only Horde
  learn 9968 npc 2836 only Alliance
  learn 9968 npc 2836 only Horde
  learn 9920
  learn 10001 npc 2836 only Alliance
  learn 10001 npc 2836 only Horde
  learn 16639 npc 2836 only Alliance
  learn 16639 npc 2836 only Horde

step Plans: Ornate Thorium Handaxe
  tip Plans: Ornate Thorium Handaxe teaches Ornate Thorium Handaxe (Blacksmithing 250) for 1g 60s. Sold by Magnus Frostwake (Western Plaguelands). Magnus is a ghost: you see him only with the Spectral Essence on (from Eva Sarkhoff's Scholomance chain, level 55, a group), so skip this without it.
  buy 12819 nearest optional

step Plans: Huge Thorium Battleaxe
  tip Plans: Huge Thorium Battleaxe teaches Huge Thorium Battleaxe (Blacksmithing 255) for 2g. Sold by Magnus Frostwake (Western Plaguelands). Magnus is a ghost: you see him only with the Spectral Essence on (from Eva Sarkhoff's Scholomance chain, level 55, a group), so skip this without it.
  buy 12823 nearest optional

