step Get Large Opal
  tip You need 10 Large Opal for Blacksmithing 225-300: Ornate Thorium Handaxe. Large Opal turns up in about one Rich Thorium Vein, Ooze Covered Rich Thorium Vein or Hakkari Thorium Vein in 143: keep the ones you find while mining. Or buy them at the Auction House.
  collect 12799 x10 anywhere gather Mining 245
  auction 12799 x10

step Blacksmithing 225-300: Auction House
  tip What 225-300 takes that the Auction House sells and no step above farms: 11 Black Pearl. The counts drop by what your bags, bank and mail hold.
  auction 7971 x11

step Dense Weightstone to 235
  tip Dense Weightstone is orange at 225 (yellow 230, green 232, grey 235): about 17 crafts to 235. Each takes 1 Dense Stone. One Dense Stone a craft (Thorium veins): cheap points at the start of Artisan.
  craft 16640 until 235

step Heavy Mithril Boots to 247
  tip Heavy Mithril Boots is yellow at 235 (yellow 230, green 240, grey 250): about 30 crafts to 247. Each takes 14 Mithril Bar and 4 Thick Leather. Mithril Bars from Mithril Deposits; Thick Leather from skinners or the Auction House. Needs an anvil nearby.
  craft 9968 until 247

step Big Black Mace to 250
  tip Big Black Mace is green at 247 (yellow 230, green 242, grey 255): about 11 crafts to 250. Each takes 16 Mithril Bar, 1 Black Pearl, 4 Shadowgem, 1 Solid Grinding Stone and 2 Thick Leather. Make the 11 Solid Grinding Stone first. Only about 11 crafts to bridge 247-250, but each wants four Shadowgems (about one Tin Vein in a hundred) and a Black Pearl: buy those at the Auction House unless your bags already hold them. Needs an anvil nearby. Black Pearl (11 for 225-300): Black Pearl is a rare drop (no mob gives it one time in 50): buy it at the Auction House, or keep the ones you find.
  craft 9920 x11
  craft 10001 until 250

step Ornate Thorium Handaxe to 255
  tip Ornate Thorium Handaxe is orange at 250 (yellow 275, green 287, grey 300): about 5 crafts to 255, a point every craft. Each takes 20 Thorium Bar, 2 Large Opal, 2 Dense Grinding Stone and 4 Rugged Leather. Make the 10 Dense Grinding Stone first. Large Opal turns up in about one Thorium vein in 130: buy the ten at the Auction House. Five crafts only, until the battleaxe plans can be used at 255. Needs an anvil nearby.
  learn 16969 optional -- from the recipe in your bags
  craft 16639 x10 optional
  craft 16969 until 255

step Huge Thorium Battleaxe to 285
  tip Huge Thorium Battleaxe is orange at 255 (yellow 280, green 292, grey 305): about 31 crafts to 285. Each takes 40 Thorium Bar, 6 Dense Grinding Stone and 6 Rugged Leather. Make the 186 Dense Grinding Stone first. Plans from Magnus Frostwake in Caer Darrow (Western Plaguelands): he is a ghost you see only with the Spectral Essence trinket on (put it on inside Caer Darrow), the reward of Eva Sarkhoff's Scholomance chain that ends with Kirtonos the Herald (level 55, a dungeon group). Unlimited stock, but the plans bind when picked up. Forty Thorium Bars and six Dense Grinding Stones a craft: the dearest stretch, so stop where the Imperial Plate Boots take over. Without the trinket, the other ways through: world-drop plans from the Auction House (the Radiant pieces: about 820 Thorium Bars and 190 Hearts of Fire for the Radiant route) or the Merchant's Favor sets. Needs an anvil nearby.
  learn 16971 optional -- from the recipe in your bags
  craft 16639 x186 optional
  craft 16971 until 285

step Plans: Imperial Plate Boots
  zone Tanaris
  tip Derotain Mudsipper (Tanaris) trades Plans: Imperial Plate Boots (Blacksmithing 270) for 40 Thorium Bar in Imperial Plate Boots, which needs Blacksmithing 265 and character level 50; take A Blue Light Bargain first (it asks for nothing). The plans bind when picked up.
  level 50
  accept 7652
  turnin 7652
  accept 7654
